// probe: stated
// about: a constant Float format argument renders in a program that renders no other Float (SL-927)
// stage 0: not run; the probe pins the rendering mono roots for a constant argument
// speeds: -O0 -O2
// prints: 1.5
// prints: 2.25
// prints: x 7 y -0.5
// Mono passes a constant format argument over as one the backend writes as
// it is, but a Float constant renders through `Printable.format` like a
// Float local, so its rendering is rooted by the argument itself.

func main() {
    print(1.5)
    print("{}", 2.25)
    print("x {} y {}", 7, -0.5)
}
